1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,845
You just turned
down one million

2
00:00:01,845 --> 00:00:04,255
dollars for a
single penny.

3
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,920
It doubles
every day

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,420
for thirty days.

5
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:08,400
Two weeks in,

6
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,230
you have eighty-one
dollars.

7
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,560
Day nineteen:

8
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,960
the pile outweighs
a horse,

9
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,390
and the
table snaps.

10
00:00:16,220 --> 00:00:17,340
Day twenty,

11
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,500
and it's still
only worth

12
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,850
five thousand
dollars.

13
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,180
Three days
later,

14
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,580
ten tons
of pennies

15
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,990
go through
the floor.

16
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:27,560
Day twenty-eight,

17
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,290
you finally beat
the million.

18
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:31,840
It doubles
twice more.

19
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,080
Your windows
burst,

20
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:34,610
then the
walls fall.

21
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:38,580
Over five
million dollars.

22
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,420
Half of it arrived
on the last day.

23
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:43,320
The million
would have fit

24
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:44,970
in a briefcase.
